# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BOS-AI / agent-11 framework scaffolding (2026-08-05)
# Library material installed into this repo by the framework, not site code.
# This is the public website repo; the framework's own files belong in
# ~/DevProjects/agent-11, not in this history, where every clone carries them.
schemas/foundation-*.schema.yaml
docs/UPGRADE.md

# agent-11 run artefacts
# Per-run output: backups, captured inbox, dated progress logs, archived
# planning docs. Regenerated on demand and meaningless to anyone cloning.
# Note: progress/ and sprints/ deliberately are NOT ignored wholesale, because
# each already holds historical files that are tracked on purpose.
.backups/
0-inbox/
progress/2026-03-19*
progress-archive.md
project-plan-archive.md
website/progress-archive.md
sprints/Sprint-6-Blog-Images-R2-Migration.md

# Blog image sources already published to R2
# jpub uploads these to the R2 bucket and writes the absolute URL into Neon,
# so the live post serves from R2 and the repo copy would be a duplicate.
# Kept on disk (jpub reads them when building social posts), just not committed.
# See website/docs/blog-images.md.
website/public/images/blog/kastrup-cosmic-mind-no-plan-*.png
